{"type":"message","id":"d5e937a9","parentId":"53e64ff6","timestamp":"2026-03-11T21:37:12.205Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_PZoSqKqiUeA8TTnSaBY7ZKBi|fc_0e9ec6a6eb09bb3c0169b1e084baf48191b591bb1d359814c9","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"│\n◇  Doctor warnings ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\n│                                                                          │\n│  - channels.telegram.groupPolicy is \"allowlist\" but groupAllowFrom (and  │\n│    allowFrom) is empty — all group messages will be silently dropped.    │\n│    Add sender IDs to channels.telegram.groupAllowFrom or                 │\n│    channels.telegram.allowFrom, or set groupPolicy to \"open\".            │\n│                                                                          │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\n[skills] Skipping skill path that resolves outside its configured root.\n[skills] Skipping skill path that resolves outside its configured root.\n[skills] Skipping skill path that resolves outside its configured root.\n[skills] Skipping skill path that resolves outside its configured root.\n[skills] Skipping skill path that resolves outside its configured root.\n[skills] Skipping skill path that resolves outside its configured root.\n[skills] Skipping skill path that resolves outside its configured root.\n[skills] Skipping skill path that resolves outside its configured root.\n[skills] Skipping skill path that resolves outside its configured root.\n[skills] Skipping skill path that resolves outside its configured root.\n[skills] Skipping skill path that resolves outside its configured root.\n[skills] Skipping skill path that resolves outside its configured root.\n[skills] Skipping skill path that resolves outside its configured root.\n[skills] Skipping skill path that resolves outside its configured root.\n[skills] Skipping skill path that resolves outside its configured root